// Hymn Source:	Popular Hymns Number 2
//		For The Work And Worship Of The Church
//		In Public Worship, Prayer-meetings, Revivals, 
//		Conventions, Sunday-schools, Young People's Meetings,	
//		Author: C. C. Cline
//		Publisher: Christian Publishing Company
//		St. Louis
